    "methods_description": "EEG was recorded with a BioSemi ActiveTwo system (71 channels in total, including scalp, EOG, and mastoid channels; CMS/DRL reference electrodes) at 512 Hz. Participants encoded the colors of 2 or 3 squares in a cued hemifield, then judged whether a single-item probe had changed color, across 1248 trials. Data were converted to BIDS with FieldTrip. Offline preprocessing and the analysis plan are described in the Stage 1 registered report protocol on OSF.",
